cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "CowTail: Tail-Root Acceleration Windows by Cattle Behaviour"
version: "1.0"
license: CC-BY-4.0
license-url: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail/blob/main/LICENSE"
repository-code: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail"
url: "https://github.com/jiaosir-cow/cowtail"
abstract: >-
  Tail-root acceleration windows from dairy cattle, pooled by behaviour.
  Four folders hold standing, lying, walking and feeding. Animal identity
  is not included. Each window is 3 by 256 samples at 50 Hz.
keywords:
  - cattle
  - dairy cattle
  - inertial measurement unit
  - accelerometer
  - animal behaviour
  - behaviour recognition
  - precision livestock farming
  - dataset
